<title>EL SALVADOR: SOCCER-US, GUATEMALA DRAW IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-US, GUATEMALA DRAW IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>SAN SALVADOR 1996-12-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The United States and Guatemala tied 2-2 (halftime 1-2) in their CONCACAF semi-final stage group one World Cup soccer qualifier Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>United States - Pedrag &quot;Preki&quot; Radosavlijevic (7), Frankie Hejduk (48).</p>
<p>Guatemala - Manuel Funes (9), Juan Carlos Plata (43).</p>
<p>Attendance: 10,000.</p>
</text>
